d_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-12T13:36:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T13:36:47Z"},{"id":633891289,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4lyGnZ","name":"stable-win-x64-Gloomberb.tar.zst","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":308701036,"digest":"sha256:2189e56bcdfb0ce381bdfc5b36bf5e382249338db6f1fdbec42921ee6be6d8c4","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-10-12T13:36:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T13:36:46Z"},{"id":633891290,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4lyGna","name":"stable-win-x64-GloomberbSetup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdos-program","state":"uploaded","size":286102655,"digest":"sha256:e73fd3a239297f4a167bed61fe28a207d3b29620843d7da174d392fab0797ffc","download_count":80,"created_at":"2026-10-12T13:36:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T13:36:50Z"},{"id":633891275,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4lyGnL","name":"stable-win-x64-update.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":73,"digest":"sha256:362efc68b7e874158fb2deff3fe5f8b77a0b2a774c623d52104a10ff0d987534","download_count":39,"created_at":"2026-10-12T13:36:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T13:36:32Z"}],"body":"## Highlights\n\n- **Share any pane.** One `Share` entry in every pane menu, or `Cmd+Shift+S` (`Ctrl+Shift+S` elsewhere), previews the pane as a picture, then posts it to a chat channel or copies a link. (#1703)\n- **Ask Gloom about any pane.** A small button beside `?`, the pane menu or `Alt+A` opens a new conversation with that pane attached. (#1690)\n- **A calmer reader.** Stories from `SRCH` and the news open with the headline and the gist, in short paragraphs without page clutter, and `n` and `p` step through results. (#1695)\n- **Chat that stays put.** The message list keeps your place, you can react with emoji in sync with Discord, and bots carry a badge. (#1701, #1693, #1706)\n- **Charts keep up.** Charts inside a pane follow a resize to the pixel, and `CMP` reads every series under the crosshair, pans without jumping and loads older bars as you pan back. (#1667, #1714, #1691)\n- **A closer `MAP`.** Zoom to a harbor, pan with the arrow keys, and see countries in proportion. (#1689)\n- **Perpetual markets everywhere.** Quote, search and list them like any other listing, with a stock's perpetual premium and funding in watchlists and portfolios. (#1698, #1660)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- Exports name their units and end with their source and dates, and `CBR` exports carry a citation per row. (#1666, #1712)\n- A held shortcut runs once per press, and theme previews and new charts paint together. (#1694, #1692)\n- `OVDV` and `OMON` fit the skew when a chain has no open interest, and `HIVG` adds per-session 25-delta skew. (#1700, #1705)\n- Command line: tables fit a narrow `--width`, an unknown function name lists the closest ones, and `shot --strict` exits non-zero when a capture is unusable. (#1713, #1699)\n- Rates: find central banks and economic series by name, and read euro and rating high-yield spreads, CDX 1M moves and the EU carbon allowance auction price. (#1711, #1668, #1671)\n- Paste a list of symbols into a watchlist from the command bar. (#1687)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.16.5...v0.16.6)\n"}
